p\">单宽带500M标准月包资费</p>\n</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\">99753124</p>\n</td><td valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:middle\">单宽带500M720元标准版一年包</p>\n</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top\">99753110</p>\n</td><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:top\">单宽带1000M标准月包资费</p>\n</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top\">99753130</p>\n</td><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:top\">单宽带1000M1200元标准版一年包</p>\n</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top\">99753131</p>\n</td><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:top\">单宽带1000M2400(元)标准版两年包</p>\n</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:top\">99753132</p>\n</td><td valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:top\">单宽带1000M3600(元)标准版三年包</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">特此公告，感谢您的理解与支持。</p>\n<p style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">中国移动通信集团湖南有限公司<br>\n2026年11月5日</p>",
